<% content_for :title, "Pipebird.io | Keep Every System in Sync" %>
<% content_for :head do %>
  <meta name="description" content="Pipebird.io syncs your CRM, product, and ops stack so customer data moves in real time without brittle scripts." />
<% end %>

<main class="landing-page">
  <header class="hero">
    <%= render "site_nav", current_page: :home %>

    <div class="hero-content">
      <p class="eyebrow">CRM integration, without the duct tape.</p>
      <h1>Write your data once. Pipebird keeps your platforms and app synced.</h1>
      <p class="hero-copy">
        Connect Salesforce, HubSpot,  and internal apps with one near real-time data stream.
        Pipebird turns broken handoffs into perfect sync across platforms.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="button primary" href="#cta">Book a demo</a>
        <a class="button secondary" href="/contact-us">Get started</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="logo-strip" aria-label="Placeholder partner logos">
      <span>SHARP AUSTRALIA</span>
      <span>GKR KARATE</span>
      <span>LEUKAEMIA FDN</span>
      <span>LIQUID LEARNING</span>
      <span>APCO</span>
      <span>YOUR APP</span>
    </section>
  </header>

  <section id="overview" class="section split overview">
    <div class="section-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Overview</p>
      <h2>Why use Pipebird for CRM integration</h2>
      <p>
        Pipebird is a no-code, real-time data integration layer built for CRM operations. Connect Salesforce,
        HubSpot, Zoho, and internal systems so updates move in both directions with clear mapping, retries, and
        audit visibility in near real time.
      </p>
      <a class="button secondary" href="#cta">Talk with a cloud architect</a>
    </div>
    <div class="data-panel">
      <h3>Sync in both directions</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>CRM to database in under 5 minutes</li>
        <li>Database to CRM with conflict-safe upserts</li>
        <li>Event logs for every field-level change</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="benefits" class="section detail-stack">
    <div class="section-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">About Pipebird for CRM integration</p>
      <h2>Why CRM Integration matters</h2>
      <ul class="bullet-list">
        <li>Maintain a consistent source of truth across sales, marketing, and support systems.</li>
        <li>Automate lead scoring, campaign actions, and customer outreach in real time.</li>
        <li>Let teams act instantly on product, support, and billing behavior inside the CRM.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="section-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Key benefits</p>
      <div class="feature-grid">
        <article>
          <h3>Real-time, two-way sync</h3>
          <p>Keep CRM and backend systems aligned without manual re-entry or stale records.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>No-code deployment</h3>
          <p>Launch integrations in minutes with pre-built connectors and visual mapping.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>Enhanced customer insights</h3>
          <p>Blend product, commerce, support, and finance signals into one customer profile.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>Workflow automation</h3>
          <p>Trigger updates, alerts, and lifecycle actions on live data changes.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>Enterprise-grade integrity</h3>
          <p>Use retries, audit trails, and validation controls to protect data quality.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>AI ready data</h3>
          <p>AI powered features requires clean, non-duplicated and matching data across systems.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="scenarios" class="section">
    <p class="eyebrow">Popular CRM integration scenarios</p>
    <h2>Use prebuilt patterns to accelerate delivery</h2>
    <div class="scenario-grid">
      <article>
        <h3>Unified customer profiles</h3>
        <p>Combine e-commerce, product, and support activity into a complete CRM view.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>Automated lead and opportunity routing</h3>
        <p>Create and update records from forms, website events, and partner sources.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>Real-time support and billing sync</h3>
        <p>Push ticket and invoice status directly into account and opportunity timelines.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>Marketing attribution and scoring</h3>
        <p>Connect campaign events to CRM workflows and keep attribution fields current.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>Bulk data operations</h3>
        <p>Safely add or update large volumes of contacts, companies, and opportunities.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>AI search and action</h3>
        <p>With data unified across all of your systems you can leverage AI search and agents.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section compare-callout">
    <p class="eyebrow">Compare the top CRM platforms</p>
    <h2>Evaluate Salesforce, HubSpot, and modern CRMs by integration readiness.</h2>
    <p>
      Use Pipebird&apos;s side-by-side templates to compare sync coverage, API limits, scalability, and total
      integration cost before committing.
    </p>
    <a class="button secondary" href="#cta">Explore CRM comparisons</a>
  </section>

  <section class="section about-block">
    <p class="eyebrow">About Pipebird</p>
    <h2>Real-time bidirectional data sync between CRMs and databases.</h2>
    <p>
      Pipebird keeps your CRM and systems like Postgres, BigQuery, and operational tools continuously aligned.
      Engineers spend less time on brittle API plumbing and more time shipping product.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="faqs" class="section faq-section">
    <p class="eyebrow">FAQs</p>
    <h2>Answers for CRM integration teams</h2>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <details open>
        <summary>What CRMs and platforms does Pipebird support?</summary>
        <p>Pipebird connects leading CRMs and data systems through reusable connectors and custom adapters.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>How does Pipebird reduce implementation time?</summary>
        <p>No-code setup, mapping templates, and managed retries eliminate most custom script work.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Can Pipebird automate lead and customer enrichment?</summary>
        <p>Yes. Pipebird can enrich records from product, support, and billing signals in real time.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Is Pipebird secure and compliant?</summary>
        <p>Pipebird uses encrypted transit/storage, audit trails, and role-based controls.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>How quickly can I launch?</summary>
        <p>Most teams ship a first production flow in days and expand from there.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Can Pipebird replace Heroku Connect?</summary>
        <p>Yes. Pipebird offers more flexibility and better performance than Heroku Connect, and is fully supported now and in the future.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section scale-section">
    <h2>Syncing data at scale across all industries.</h2>
    <ul class="scale-points">
      <li>14-day trial</li>
      <li>Two-way, real-time sync</li>
      <li>Workflow automation</li>
      <li>White-glove onboarding</li>
    </ul>
    <blockquote>
      "We've been using Pipebird across multiple projects and cannot imagine returning to manual sync jobs."
    </blockquote>
  </section>

  <section id="cta" class="section callout">
    <%= image_tag "pipebird-logo.png", alt: "pipebird logo", class: "cta-logo" %>
    <p class="eyebrow">Ready to launch</p>
    <h2>Pipebird.io is your clean data layer for revenue teams.</h2>
    <p>
      This page uses placeholder logos and copy for now. Swap in final brand assets when ready.
    </p>
    <a class="button primary" href="mailto:contact@pipebird.io">Contact us</a>
  </section>
</main>
